+++ b/.changeset/original-accents-not-red.md
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+---
+"@ux-builder/tokens": minor
+---
+
+The original Praxis, Praxis v2 and Synaptiq themes stop using red for links, selection, focus and kickers, as color.red-reserved asks, taking the accents their vk- copies already have: the praxis brand (praxis, praxis-carbon, praxis-fluentui, praxis-material) #255FB1 in light and #578EDB in dark, praxis-v2 (praxis-v2-databricks) #2969C2 and #5F94DD, and synaptiq's light appearance Arctic, deepened to #4D728F. Each clears 4.7:1 on every ground and surface. Red stays for errors, destructive actions, the Praxis logo and Synaptiq's critical status.
